  "alternative_titles": "Reincarnated as the Grand Duke’s Third Son, Reencarnado como o terceiro filho do Grão-Duque, 환생했더니 대공의 셋째 아들, A Mercenary's Rebirth Among Nobles, Reencarné como el tercer hijo del gran duque, Reincarnated as the Archduke's Third Son, Reinkarniert als der dritte Sohn des Herzogs, บุตรคนที่สามของแกรนด์ดยุก, 元傭兵団長、大公家の三男に転生する～才能と家柄ですべてを蹂躙する最強貴族ライフ～, 轉生為大公家的三兒子, 转世成为公爵家的三儿子, 환생했더니 대공이 셋째 아들, Reincarnated as the Archduke’s Son",
